- Incluir o novo `auth.router` nos roteadores do FastAPI.

#### [NEW] [seed_auth.py](file:///d:/Projectos/I2A2/Labs/DO%20Insight%20%E2%80%94%20Intelligent%20Policy%20Analysis/do-intelligence/backend/seed_auth.py)
- Script para criar perfis padrão (`admin`, `underwriter`, `user`) e o utilizador administrador inicial (`admin@dointelligence.com`).

